{"id":31988,"mal_id":31988,"title":"Hibike! Euphonium 2","englishTitle":"Sound! Euphonium 2","title_english":"Sound! Euphonium 2","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Hibike! Euphonium Second Season"],"en":"Sound! Euphonium 2","ja":"響け！ユーフォニアム2"},"synopsis":"Following their success in the qualifying round for the Kansai regional competition, the members of the Kitauji High School concert band set their sights on the next upcoming performance. Utilizing their summer break to the utmost, the band participates in a camp where they are instructed by their band advisor Noboru Taki and his friends who make their living as professional musicians.\n\nKumiko Oumae and her friends remain determined to attain gold at the Kansai competition, but trouble arises when a student who once quit the band shows interest in rejoining and sparks unpleasant memories for the second-year members. Kumiko also learns about her teacher's surprising past and the motivation behind his desire to lead the band to victory. Reaching nationals will require hard work, and the adamant conviction in each student's commitment to the band will be put to the test.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Tras su éxito en la ronda de clasificación para la competencia regional de Kansai, los miembros de la banda de conciertos de la escuela secundaria Kitauji fijaron su mirada en la próxima actuación. Aprovechando al máximo sus vacaciones de verano, la banda participa en un campamento donde reciben instrucción de su asesor de banda, Noboru Taki, y sus amigos, quienes se ganan la vida como músicos profesionales.\n\nKumiko Oumae y sus amigos siguen decididos a conseguir el oro en la competición de Kansai, pero surgen problemas cuando un estudiante que una vez abandonó la banda muestra interés en volver a unirse y genera recuerdos desagradables para los miembros de segundo año. Kumiko también aprende sobre el sorprendente pasado de su maestro y la motivación detrás de su deseo de llevar a la banda a la victoria. Llegar a los nacionales requerirá trabajo duro y se pondrá a prueba la firme convicción en el compromiso de cada estudiante con la banda.\n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1530,"average_episode_duration":1530,"startDate":"2016-10-06","start_date":"2016-10-06","endDate":"2016-12-29","end_date":"2016-12-29","season":"fall","year":2016,"start_season":{"year":2016,"season":"fall"},"episodes":13,"num_episodes":13,"score":8.35,"mean":8.35,"numListUsers":261762,"num_list_users":261762,"genres":[{"id":8,"name":"Drama"},{"id":19,"name":"Music"},{"id":70,"name":"Performing Arts"},{"id":23,"name":"School"}],"studios":[{"id":2,"name":"Kyoto Animation"}],"pictures":[],"backdrop_url":null,"logo_url":null,"tmdb_id":null,"tmdb_updated_at":null,"images":{"jpg":{"image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/10/81155.webp","large_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/10/81155l.webp"}},"main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/10/81155.webp","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/10/81155l.webp"},"trailer":{"images":{"maximum_image_url":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/10/81155l.webp"}},"broadcast":{"day":"thursday","time":"00:00","day_of_the_week":"thursday","start_time":"00:00","timezone":"Asia/Tokyo","string":"thursday 00:00"},"rank":286,"popularity":1113,"rating":"pg_13","simkl_id":null,"episodes_data":[],"specials_data":[],"characters":[],"num_scoring_users":138920,"nsfw":"white","created_at":"2015-10-31T12:22:22+00:00","updated_at":"2025-07-03T08:32:47+00:00","source":"novel","background":null,"related_anime":[{"node":{"id":27989,"title":"Hibike! Euphonium","main_picture":{"medium":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1517/142072.jpg","large":"https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1517/142072l.jpg"}},"relation_type":"prequel","relation_type_formatted":"Prequel"},{"node":{"id":34204,"title":"Hibike! Euphonium 2 Specials"